@* ===== Home: short "Why visit Armenia" section ===== *@
<section class="section section--sand" id="why-visit">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head section-head--center">
            <span class="eyebrow">Why Armenia</span>
            <h2>Why visit Armenia?</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="why-grid">
            <div class="why-item">
                <span class="why-item__num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
                <h3>History you can touch</h3>
                <p>Armenia adopted Christianity as a state religion in the early 4th century. Its monasteries, khachkars (carved cross-stones) and cathedrals are among the oldest in the world.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="why-item">
                <span class="why-item__num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
                <h3>Mountains and lakes</h3>
                <p>Most of the country sits above 1,000 m. Hike in Dilijan's forests, swim in Lake Sevan, or ride the cable car over the Vorotan gorge.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="why-item">
                <span class="why-item__num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
                <h3>Hospitality and the table</h3>
                <p>Lavash, khorovats, apricots, and wine from the world's oldest known winery — shared with people who will insist you stay for one more toast.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
